<div class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>How we handle your data</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card" style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:left;">
      <h3>1. Data We Collect</h3>
      <p class="text-muted">We collect account data (name, email, user type), application data (resumes, cover letters, video uploads when enabled), and usage data (job views, search queries). We do not sell your data.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:2rem;">2. How We Use It</h3>
      <p class="text-muted">To match job seekers with employers, process one-click applications, and improve search relevance. Employers only see data for jobs you explicitly apply to.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:2rem;">3. Storage & Security</h3>
      <p class="text-muted">Data is stored in MongoDB with access logging. Passwords are hashed with bcrypt. Sessions are HTTP-only, SameSite=Lax, Secure in production.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:2rem;">4. Retention</h3>
      <p class="text-muted">We retain account and application data until you delete your account. You may request deletion via <a href="/contact">contact</a>.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:2rem;">5. Contact</h3>
      <p class="text-muted">Questions? Contact support@whitecollars.example.com</p>

      <p class="text-muted" style="margin-top:2rem; font-size:0.85rem;">Last updated: 2025-10-09</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
